<div class="ats-store-page">
  <section class="ats-store-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-hero__grid"><div><p class="ats-store-kicker" id="atsStoreKicker">Locations</p><h1 id="atsStoreTitle">American Tire Stores Location</h1><p id="atsStoreIntro">Shop tires, wheels, packages, and auto services at your selected American Tire Stores location.</p><ul class="ats-store-meta"><li id="atsStoreAddr">Select a store from the Locations page.</li><li>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm · Sat 8am–5pm · Sun closed</li></ul><div class="ats-store-actions"><a class="ats-btn red" id="atsStoreTires" href="/pages/tire-search">Shop tires →</a><a class="ats-btn call" id="atsStoreCall" href="tel:+18056443330">Call</a><a class="ats-btn ghost" id="atsStoreBook" href="/pages/services">Book a service</a><a class="ats-btn ghost" id="atsStoreDirections" href="#">Get directions</a></div></div><aside class="ats-store-hours"><img id="atsStoreImage" src="{{ 'netlify-locations-05-5746055301668a88.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="American Tire Stores storefront"><div class="ats-store-hours__body"><span class="ats-store-open">● Closed today</span><div class="ats-store-hours__row"><b>Mon–Fri</b><b>8:00am – 6:00pm</b></div><div class="ats-store-hours__row"><span>Saturday</span><span>8:00am – 5:00pm</span></div><div class="ats-store-hours__row"><span>Sunday</span><span>Closed</span></div><a class="ats-store-directions" id="atsStoreDirectionsCard" href="#">● Get directions →</a></div></aside></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-widget"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-widget__head"><h2 id="atsStoreWidgetTitle">Get rolling at American Tire Stores</h2><p>Choose your service or tires. TireConnect keeps your search and appointment request tied to this location.</p></div><div class="ats-store-widget__tabs"><button type="button" class="active" data-ats-tc="book">Book a service</button><button type="button" data-ats-tc="shop">Shop tires &amp; wheels</button></div><div class="ats-store-widget__panel"><p class="ats-store-widget__lead" id="atsStoreWidgetLead"><b>Request an appointment.</b> Select a service, vehicle, and preferred time — the shop confirms.</p><div class="ats-store-widget__target" id="atsStoreWidgetTarget"><span class="ats-store-widget__loading">Loading appointment request form...<small>Choose service, vehicle, and a preferred date and time.</small></span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">How booking works</p><h2>From request to back on the road</h2><p>Book online, check in at your selected store, approve the work, and get back on the road.</p></div><div class="ats-store-steps"><div class="ats-store-step"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose your service, vehicle, and preferred time.</p></div><div class="ats-store-step"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Your advisor confirms the details at the store.</p></div><div class="ats-store-step"><b>3</b><h3>Inspect &amp; quote</h3><p>Review an upfront quote before work begins.</p></div><div class="ats-store-step"><b>4</b><h3>Back on the road</h3><p>Drive away with work completed by certified technicians.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">Auto service</p><h2 id="atsStoreServiceTitle">Auto service, done right</h2><p>From routine maintenance to repairs, choose the service you need at this location.</p></div><div class="ats-store-service-cards"><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>Oil change</h3><p>Protect your engine with the right oil and filter.</p><a href="/pages/services">Book service →</a></div><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>Wheel alignment</h3><p>Help tires wear evenly and your vehicle track straight.</p><a href="/pages/services">Book service →</a></div><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Inspection, pads, rotors, and dependable stopping power.</p><a href="/pages/services">Book service →</a></div><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>Tire installation</h3><p>Mounting, balancing, and TPMS service for new tires.</p><a href="/pages/tire-search">Shop tires →</a></div><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>TPMS service</h3><p>Diagnose and replace pressure-monitoring sensors.</p><a href="/pages/services">Book service →</a></div><div class="ats-store-service-card"><h3>Battery service</h3><p>Testing and replacement to keep you starting strong.</p><a href="/pages/services">Book service →</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="atsStoreKnowTitle">Good to know before you visit</h2></div><div class="ats-store-amenities"><div class="ats-store-amenity">✓ Certified technicians</div><div class="ats-store-amenity">✓ Upfront estimates</div><div class="ats-store-amenity">✓ Same-day service when available</div><div class="ats-store-amenity">✓ Financing available</div></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">Find us</p><h2 id="atsStoreMapTitle">How to find us</h2><p id="atsStoreMapLead">Get directions to this American Tire Stores location.</p></div><div class="ats-store-map"><iframe id="atsStoreMap" title="Store location map" loading="lazy"></iframe></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">Answers</p><h2 id="atsStoreFaqTitle">Store FAQ</h2></div><div class="ats-store-faq"><details><summary>Do I need an appointment?</summary><p>Walk-ins are welcome when capacity allows, but booking online helps the store reserve time for your service.</p></details><details><summary>Can you install tires bought elsewhere?</summary><p>Yes. Request a tire installation appointment and the store will confirm the service and timing.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer financing?</summary><p>Flexible financing options are available for qualifying tire, wheel, and auto-service purchases.</p></details><details><summary>How do I get local pricing?</summary><p>Choose this store in TireConnect, enter your vehicle or tire size, and browse the products that fit.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="ats-store-section__head"><p class="ats-store-section__eyebrow">Near you</p><h2>Other American Tire Stores</h2></div><div class="ats-store-other"><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Ventura<span>5100 Telegraph Rd</span></a><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Thousand Oaks<span>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd</span></a><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Glendale<span>737 S Glendale Ave</span></a><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Glendale II<span>1130 S Central Ave</span></a><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Bellflower<span>9509 Alondra Blvd</span></a><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Cathedral City<span>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="ats-store-body"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>Services available here</h2>
    <p style="color:#54617a;line-height:1.7;max-width:760px">Shop tires, wheels, packages, and auto service at this American Tire Stores location. The selected store is saved for TireConnect and service booking.</p>
    <div class="ats-store-services">
      <div class="ats-store-service">Tires & installation</div>
